                      (    forth6809.asm):00899         ; TSTSWAP - unit test for SWAP ( n1 n2 -- n2 n1 ). Verifies the
                      (    forth6809.asm):00900         ; two items exchange places, the guard beneath is undisturbed,
                      (    forth6809.asm):00901         ; and the net stack depth is unchanged.
