                      (    forth6809.asm):03924         ; TSTLOGIC - logic, shift, and address-arithmetic tests (glossary
                      (    forth6809.asm):03925         ; section 3.6). Covers every word in that section. Several of
                      (    forth6809.asm):03926         ; these (INVERT, CELLS, CELL+, CHARS, CHAR+, ALIGNED) modify the
                      (    forth6809.asm):03927         ; top of stack in place (LDD/op/STD) rather than PULU/PSHU - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):03928         ; tests verify what's observable via the stack either way, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):03929         ; how each implementation gets there. Three words (CHARS, ALIGN,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03930         ; ALIGNED) are documented no-ops on this system; CHARS/ALIGNED
                      (    forth6809.asm):03931         ; still get a normal single-value test (verifying identity),
                      (    forth6809.asm):03932         ; while ALIGN - which takes no stack arguments at all - gets a
                      (    forth6809.asm):03933         ; dedicated test pushing decoy values to confirm the whole stack,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03934         ; not just one value, is genuinely undisturbed. RSHIFT tested
                      (    forth6809.asm):03935         ; against a negative input specifically, since it's documented
                      (    forth6809.asm):03936         ; logical (zero-fill), not arithmetic (sign-preserving) - the
                      (    forth6809.asm):03937         ; case that actually distinguishes the two conventions, same
                      (    forth6809.asm):03938         ; reasoning already applied to 2/ and FM/MOD vs SM/REM earlier.
                      (    forth6809.asm):03939         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
C19F BDFC2B           (    forth6809.asm):03940         TSTLOGIC:  JSR   CRW
C1A2 8EC1B3           (    forth6809.asm):03941                    LDX   #TSTLOGICMSG
C1A5 3610             (    forth6809.asm):03942                    PSHU  X
C1A7 CC0005           (    forth6809.asm):03943                    LDD   #5
C1AA 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03944                    PSHU  D
