                      (    forth6809.asm):04504         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
                      (    forth6809.asm):04505         ; TSTCOMPARE - comparison tests (glossary section 3.7). Covers
                      (    forth6809.asm):04506         ; every word in that section. Like several words in the previous
                      (    forth6809.asm):04507         ; group, most of these modify the top of stack in place rather
                      (    forth6809.asm):04508         ; than PULU/PSHU - the tests verify what's observable via the
                      (    forth6809.asm):04509         ; stack either way. Signed vs unsigned comparisons (</U<, >/U>)
                      (    forth6809.asm):04510         ; each tested with a case that would give the opposite answer
                      (    forth6809.asm):04511         ; under the other convention, confirming genuine sign-awareness
