DEFA CCFF9D           (    forth6809.asm):08175         SWIH:    LDD   #-99             ; placeholder hardware-trap code; push and
DEFD 3606             (    forth6809.asm):08176                  PSHU  D                 ; JMP THROW, per the CATCH/THROW turn
