E8C1 3606             (    forth6809.asm):09768                  PSHU  D          ; 10,S, which was itself wrong - it assumed
E8C3 39               (    forth6809.asm):09769                  RTS              ; DOSETUP's own JSR-pushed return address
                      (    forth6809.asm):09770                                   ; persists on S once each DOSETUP finishes.
                      (    forth6809.asm):09771                                   ; It doesn't: DOSETUP's own RTS pops and
                      (    forth6809.asm):09772                                   ; consumes it to jump into the loop body, so
