                      (    forth6809.asm):09774                                   ; past. Re-traced by counting every real
                      (    forth6809.asm):09775                                   ; push/pop across a nested DO: after the
                      (    forth6809.asm):09776                                   ; inner DOSETUP finishes, S is [inner-index@0]
                      (    forth6809.asm):09777                                   ; [inner-limit@2][inner-leave@4][outer-
                      (    forth6809.asm):09778                                   ; index@6][outer-limit@8][outer-leave@10] -
                      (    forth6809.asm):09779                                   ; J's own JSR pushes one more cell on top,
                      (    forth6809.asm):09780                                   ; landing outer-index at 8, not 10. Offset 10
                      (    forth6809.asm):09781                                   ; read the outer loop's limit instead - a
                      (    forth6809.asm):09782                                   ; fixed value every iteration, exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):09783                                   ; matching the observed bug (J stuck at the
                      (    forth6809.asm):09784                                   ; limit, never progressing). Confirmed via a
