                      (    forth6809.asm):12946                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):12947                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):12948                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):12949                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):12950                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):12951                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):12952                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):12953                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
